{
  "env": {
    "userData": "a copy of $TMPDIR/ud-followup-hud-biome (the world V6AU-HW5A on aether-land 1.2.0, with the places 東沙丘 and 冰洞迷迷宮 already written) at $TMPDIR/ud-rename-check; the UI language stored there was ja",
    "debugPort": 9338,
    "build": "main at 9642f9a + the uncommitted rev 6 phase-1 working tree, the rename and the LandView2D fix (bun run dev)",
    "window": "1440 × 868",
    "note": "The eval steps that import /state/index.ts read the stores; one step writes a teleport request the way a door does, to stand for a door travel made earlier in the walk."
